      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好，我就来使出一记公主☆擒抱──\n啊，身体的动作不协调，跑不快！\n怎么会这样～～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1554e063df34bb6b4f9e6be1199749f7aee2d174639549b3ef04ae100f7d9487",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
