      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我今天来观摩“伊丽莎白女王杯”！\n在众人屏气凝神的激烈竞赛中拿下胜利的，\n是小魔女赛马娘东商变革！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2fd095bff08512b2fd3014d6b5e241f4deb39fab39622acbc40d8cdd9632306",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
